@baseUrl = http://localhost:5237
@token = 
# Optional: override the default seed data source with ?sourceUrl=
@sourceUrl = https://example.com/seed.json

### Seed talents (returns created / updated / total)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifiseeding/talents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seed talents from a custom source url
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifiseeding/talents?sourceUrl={{sourceUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seed classes (returns created / updated / total / skippedClasses / skippedTalents)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifiseeding/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seed backgrounds (returns created / updated / total / skippedTalents)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifiseeding/backgrounds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seed races (returns created / skipped / total)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifiseeding/races
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seed subraces (seed races first; returns created / skipped / total)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifiseeding/subraces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Seed weapons (returns created / skipped / total)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scifi/scifiseeding/weapons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
